  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>믕<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9B9ZZSsct7w?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>簡單<rt>간ˆ단ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>傷過<rt>슐ˉ궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>簡單<rt>간ˆ단ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-kân-tân goà siṵ̄’e siṵ̄-kuè-kân-tân\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>設計<rt>셷ˆ게</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>感覺<rt>감ˆ각ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>設計<rt>셷ˆ게</rt></ruby>’킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-siêt-ke goà kâm-kâk-hor-lì siêt-ke’khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>免<rt>뼨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>怨嘆<rt>완ˋ탄</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>傷<rt>슐ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>歹款<rt>팰ˆ콴ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    biên-oàn-than kâm-si-goà siṵ̄-kuè-phâ̰i-khoàn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>傷<rt>슐ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>期待<rt>기태ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ya-si-goà siṵ̄-joē’e ki-thāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>馬<rt>마</rt></ruby> <ruby>猶<rt>얗ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>樂觀<rt>럭관ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kàu-jît-ma yâh-lêh-lork-koân\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>冤仇<rt>완ˉ슈ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𨘗<rt>위ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>打<rt>달ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>開始<rt>캐ˉ시ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>冤仇<rt>완ˉ슈ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-oān-siú wì-tâ̰-khāi-sì bo-oān-siú\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>誠<rt>쟐-</rt></ruby><ruby>討債<rt>토ˆ제</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>欠<rt>캼ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>偌<rt>똬-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jia̰-thô-je goà ma-bo-khiàm-lì roa-joē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>敢<rt>갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>睏<rt>쿤</rt></ruby> <ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>開始<rt>캐ˉ시ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>眠夢<rt>삔빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-kâ̰-khun kiā̰-goà e-khāi-sì bin-bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>夢<rt>빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>可能<rt>코ˆ롕ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>代誌<rt>대지</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bang-tioh-bo-khô-liéng’e tai-ji\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>夢<rt>빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>工<rt>강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>拄<rt>두ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>開始<rt>캐ˉ시ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bang-tioh-hît-kâng làn tû-khāi-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>’춛킈 <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>个<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>門<rt>믕ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kiá̰’chut-khi hît-e-mńg\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>關<rt>귈ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà yêng-oân-lông-boe-kṵ̂i\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>斡頭<rt>왇ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>輸人<rt>수ˉ랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-oat-tháu tio-sū-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>後擺<rt>ᄋᅷ배ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>拄<rt>두ˋ</rt></ruby>’둏 <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>相<rt>쇼ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>閃<rt>샴ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    au-pài tù’tioh boe-siō-siàm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>’춛래에 <ruby>話<rt>웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kòng’chut-lai-e wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>記<rt>기</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà yêng-oân-lông-e-ki\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>同齊<rt>당죄-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>日子<rt>띧즤ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-bêh-tang-joe-kuè-rit-jì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>結果<rt>곋ˆ고ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>各人<rt>걱ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>家己<rt>가ˉ기ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiêt-kò kôrk-láng kuè-kā-kī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>怪<rt>괘ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>命運<rt>먀운ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>全部<rt>좐버-</rt></ruby><ruby>怪<rt>괘ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>命運<rt>먀운ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    koài-mia-ūn goà joan-por-koài-mia-ūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣<rt>옌-</rt></ruby>份 <ruby>可能<rt>코ˆ롕-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>歹<rt>팰ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>頂世<rt>뎽ˆ시</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-yen khô-lieng-goà phâ̰i-láng tiêng-si\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>甘願<rt>감ˉ꽌ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>認真<rt>띤진ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-kām-goān kâm-si-goà bo-lêh-rin-jîn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>昨<rt>좋ˆ</rt></ruby>’띧 <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>代<rt>대</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>誌<rt>지</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jôh’rit ma-kôh-bo-tai bo-ji\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>煞<rt>쇃ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>馬<rt>마</rt></ruby> <ruby>準備<rt>준ˆ비-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>離開<rt>리퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    soâh-jît-ma jûn-pi-bêh-li-khûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>可以<rt>코ˆ이ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>接受<rt>쟙ˆ슈-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>煞煞<rt>쇃ˆ쇃</rt></ruby>’킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà khô-ì jiâp-siu-làn lông-soâh-soah’khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>問題<rt>뿐되ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>顛踱<rt>톈ˉ톻-</rt></ruby><ruby>自由自在<rt>주유주재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-bun-toé goà thiēn-thoh-ju-yu-ju-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>白賊<rt>벻찯ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>騙人<rt>폔ˋ랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-peh-chât bak-sài ma-jāi-goà phièn-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>足<rt>젹ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>對<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>大細聲<rt>돠쇠ˋ샬ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiôrk-siṵ-bêh-tùi-lì toa-soè-siâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>結果<rt>곋ˆ고ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>賰<rt>춘ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>房間<rt>방곙ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>空空<rt>캉ˉ캉ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiêt-kò chūn-pang-kiêng khāng-khâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>’춛킈 <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>个<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>門<rt>믕ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kiá̰’chut-khi h